### Recipes, shopping & diet generation. Set @host from the Aspire dashboard's "api" endpoint.
@host = https://localhost:7443
@subject = demo-user

### List recipes — seeded recipes are GLOBAL (isGlobal); your imports are private (isMine).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/recipes
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### Create a recipe (nutrition is computed from resolved ingredients). Private to {{subject}}.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recipes
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tofu rice bowl",
  "servings": 2,
  "totalMinutes": 20,
  "tags": ["vegan", "high-protein", "dinner"],
  "ingredients": [
    { "quantity": 200, "unit": "g", "name": "tofu" },
    { "quantity": 300, "unit": "g", "name": "white rice" },
    { "quantity": 100, "unit": "g", "name": "spinach" }
  ]
}

### Edit a recipe you own (404 if not visible, 403 if visible-but-not-yours).
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/recipes/REPLACE-WITH-RECIPE-ID
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tofu rice bowl (edited)",
  "servings": 3,
  "totalMinutes": 25,
  "tags": ["vegan", "high-protein", "dinner"],
  "ingredients": [
    { "quantity": 300, "unit": "g", "name": "tofu" },
    { "quantity": 400, "unit": "g", "name": "white rice" }
  ]
}

### Delete a recipe you own.
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/recipes/REPLACE-WITH-RECIPE-ID
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Admin: create a GLOBAL recipe everyone can use (Global honored only for the admin role).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recipes
X-Debug-Subject: admin-user
X-Debug-Role: admin
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "House high-protein bowl",
  "servings": 2,
  "totalMinutes": 15,
  "tags": ["high-protein", "dinner"],
  "ingredients": [ { "quantity": 200, "unit": "g", "name": "chicken" } ],
  "global": true
}

### Admin: promote one of your private recipes to GLOBAL (admin-only; 403 for a plain user).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recipes/REPLACE-WITH-RECIPE-ID/promote-global
X-Debug-Subject: admin-user
X-Debug-Role: admin
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Generate a diet plan (structured — no LLM key needed). Returns 202 + a plan id.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/diet-plans
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dietSlug": "high-protein", "horizonDays": 7 }

### Free-text desire (needs an LLM provider configured)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/diet-plans
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "desire": "high-protein vegan, around 2000 kcal, nothing with mushrooms, under 25 minutes" }

### Poll the plan until status is ready | infeasible
GET {{host}}/api/v1/diet-plans/REPLACE-WITH-PLAN-ID
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### Accept, then close the loop into a shopping list
POST {{host}}/api/v1/diet-plans/REPLACE-WITH-PLAN-ID/accept
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/diet-plans/REPLACE-WITH-PLAN-ID/shopping-list
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

### Adherence: logged intake vs the plan this week
GET {{host}}/api/v1/diet-plans/REPLACE-WITH-PLAN-ID/adherence
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
